Package: stats19reports
Title: Local Authority Road Safety Reports from STATS19 Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Blaise", "Kelly", email = "blaise@activeanalytics.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds reproducible road safety reports for any Great Britain
    Local Authority from DfT 'STATS19' collision, casualty and vehicle data.
    Summarises casualties by Local Authority, LSOA, MSOA, Index of Multiple
    Deprivation, OpenStreetMap road link and speed limit; values collisions
    using DfT 'TAG'/'RAS4001' costs; produces static and interactive 'tmap'
    maps, 'ggplot2' charts and 'gt'/'reactable' tables; and renders a
    parameterised 'Quarto' report.
